# Does [Shape.Circle payload]: payload.r bind payload in the non-case arm form?
# Under T-1154, bare lowercase names in pattern position are Pin patterns.
# If the name is not in scope, the T-1154 comment says it acts as a wildcard,
# meaning payload would NOT be bound and payload.r would fail.
[
  Shape: [type [Circle r: Int]]
  sh:    [Shape.Circle r: 5]
  area:  [match sh
    [Shape.Circle payload]: [* payload.r payload.r]
    _:                      0]
]
